### silencing both streams in sh
#!/bin/sh
ping -c1 localhost &> /dev/null
>>> SC3020 2:20

### silencing both streams in dash
#!/bin/dash
ping -c1 localhost &> /dev/null
>>> SC3020 2:20

### silencing both streams is accepted in busybox
#!/bin/busybox sh
# shellcheck shell=busybox
echo probe &> /dev/null
>>> none
